\viewkind4\uc1\pard\li270\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\ulnone\b0 
\par Songs of praise to Christ the Saviour\cf0  
\par For He's Jehovah!
\par Give Him all thanks, give Him all praise 
\par All people on earth.
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par It befits all believers
\par  To uplift His Holy name. 
\par  Give Him all thanks, give Him all praise
\par  Bless His Holy Name.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6  Verse 2\ulnone\b0 
\par 2.\cf0  Ye believers, they that fear Him, 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Rejoice in the Lord; 
\par Solace they find in their comfort, 
\par Pleasing to the Lord.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Love to His children bestowed;
\par In times of tribulations,
\par Courage He gives them to be still,
\par To glorify Him.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Unbelievers and the heathen 
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 And unnumbered foes;
\par Children of Christ, courage gather,
\par they to war with ease.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par With the Gospel, God's armour 
\par and to each, put on with pray'r;
\par With that sword and fighting spirit, 
\par Shall conquer the foe.
\par 
\par \pard\fi-225\li225\sl190\slmult0\cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. God's chosen, people of Israel!
\par \pard\li225\sl190\slmult0 Be cheerful alway,
\par That your Creator and Saviour 
\par Loving care He gives.
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par Thou who are Zion daughters, 
\par Exceeding glad ye shall be, 
\par See! your King has had the power, 
\par in Heav'n and on earth !
\par \pard\cf1\f1 
\par \ul\b\f2 
\par }

